{"steam_appid":619390,"steam_name":"Oddworld: Soulstorm Enhanced Edition","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/619390/473400/b852b5c40ab1f93036720c45d852d2c5b03a73e8/1751108997/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1655830958","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256892706/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1655830958","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/ss_fde4692f836bdb06efb29eb8dde99d6664f463ab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784816209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/ss_f3ef9ad2a81e922121da3bdf19d718047bc8d037.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784816209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/ss_973e1ba72c05400d04047b71533455cf27ee03a6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784816209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/ss_e9a375b8c7dadadf05a2f6d93ff91abe334a9b8b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784816209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/ss_f53a4bbf36fe2ef909216e9ac3b398cfe31317aa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784816209"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/968cd735dbeb30c7a31232b9e8e07134.poster.avif?t=1784816209\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/968cd735dbeb30c7a31232b9e8e07134.webm?t=1784816209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/968cd735dbeb30c7a31232b9e8e07134.mp4?t=1784816209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As 300 freshly liberated slaves celebrate their escape from the industrial megacomplex of RuptureFarms, a new menace rises. They will soon discover that, although their physical bonds were broken, they are far from free. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the revolution as you guide their savior, Abe, on an almost impossible journey to uncover the truth behind the generations of disinformation and misleading news that have brainwashed his people. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/6a274e2c89e77e7da86c95c2e64f63f6.poster.avif?t=1784816209\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/6a274e2c89e77e7da86c95c2e64f63f6.webm?t=1784816209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/6a274e2c89e77e7da86c95c2e64f63f6.mp4?t=1784816209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge for items and craft powerful tools, arm your followers and choose to attack the enemy head on or to take a stealthier approach to unlocking each of the four possible endings to this epic tale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Abe find a way to heal his friends and finally win their freedom? What other horrors will they uncover on their deadly journey through dusty canyons, abandoned mines, immense container yards and cavernous train terminals? Is this merely the next step towards liberation or is it really the end of the line? Only you can give them the hope they need to find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/4821b075b751bc048a503f87ee56c416.poster.avif?t=1784816209\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/4821b075b751bc048a503f87ee56c416.webm?t=1784816209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/619390/extras/4821b075b751bc048a503f87ee56c416.mp4?t=1784816209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4460 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GeForce GTX 970 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> While development is ongoing, all above specs are subject to change.</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Oddworld Inhabitants"],"publishers":["Oddworld Inhabitants"],"release_date":"21 Jun, 2022","metacritic_score":73}